      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "sandbox is a kind of POD and kuber cluster don't give permission to any pod to create a new independent pod \nusske lie hume ek file bnani hai rbac.yml\nrbac.yml mai ek tarike se resource.manager banate hai taaki uss se kissi pod ko ye permission mil jaaye ki vo kya kya kr skta hai\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "sandbox is a kind of POD and kuber cluster don't give permission to any pod to create a new independent pod \nusske lie hume ek file bnani hai rbac.yml\nrbac.yml mai ek tarike se resource.manager banate hai taaki uss se kissi pod ko ye permission mil jaaye ki vo kya kya kr skta hai\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
